hat one day she  wouldn't marry a high Lord and rule his  castle and their sons would be knights  and princes but Aria said no that's not  me you will marry a high Lord and rule  his castle your son's shall be nice and  princes and Lords That's not me at the  time Aria had no intentions of living  her life as a lady like her sister  Songza wanted to ever since aria told  her father that she really hasn't shown  any signs of settling down and having a  family so it seems like aria will never  live that kind of a life whenever people  talk about Arya Stark in her future they  usually base it on what Aria said in  that scene because she said she never  wanted to get married and have kids so  we tend to take our word for it but how  do we know what Ned said won't come true  how do we know that Ned wasn't  foreshadowing arias future when he said  she would get married and have kids  as a child aria is a lot like her aunt  Lyanna stark there are several different  quotes in the books that compare these  two characters there was another time  Aria had a conversation with Ned and he  compared her to Leona twice this was  when Ned discovered that Aria had a  sword needle and this is what he said  Aria you have a wildness in you child  the wolf's blood my father used to call  it Liana had a touch of it and my  brother Brandon more than a touch it  brought them both to an early grave as  you can see Aria is a lot like Leona as  a child they were both tough who liked  to get dirty and fight and ride horses  and things like that  Ned knows that Aria has this wolf's  blood too and he says that it led to an  early grave for Leona so let's just hope  it doesn't mean the same for Aria but  perhaps this is foreshadowing arias fate  during this same conversation  Genet also says Liana might have carried  a sword if my lord father had allowed it  you remind me of her sometimes you even  look like her when Ned says this Aria  doesn't really think so because people  said Liana was beautiful and no one ever  said Aria was beautiful in fact people  used to make fun of Aria because of the  way she looked she would be called horse  face or lumpy head and things like that  but you have to remember at the time  aria is very young and she's a tomboy  she's always fighting with other boys  and she's always dirty and wearing  raggedy clothes but as Aria gets older  she does become a lot prettier like  Liana so perhaps they were both late  bloomers when Aria is at the house of  black and white we are told that she is  turning into a beautiful young lady  while Aria is there she thinks she has  no other place to go because most of our  family is dead but the kindly man she is  talking to tells her she does have other  options this is what he says you believe  this is the only place for you you are  wrong in that you would find softer  service in the household of some  merchants or you would sooner be a  courtesan and have songs sung of your  beauty speak the word and we will send  you to the Black Pearl or the daughter  of the dusk you will sleep on rose  petals and wear silken skirts that  rustle when you walk in great lords will  beggar themselves for your maidens blood  or if it is marriage and children you  desire tell me and we shall find a  husband for you some honest apprentice  boy a rich old man a Seafarer whatever  you desire no one said these things to  Aria when she was very young but now  that she is getting older she is  starting to change you have to keep in  mind the kindly man is a faceless man he  has seen thousands and thousands of  faces so if he thinks Aria is beautiful  then she probably is the older and more  beautiful aria starts to become her  heart's desire may change in terms of  the things that she wants in her life  Lyanna stark probably faced these same  things when leona was a little girl she  probably never thought of getting  married or settling down at the time she  probably just wanted to ride horses and  train in the practice yard just like  Aria but as she grew  up and became more beautiful she did  decide she wanted other things there are  a few more comparisons in some of the  other chapters Aria is also said to  write a horse just like her own Liana  they both ride horses like Northman and  this shows how they are a lot alike  other than just their looks but we have  already seen examples where people see  Aria and they think of Liana so this  leads me to one a branch chapters in a  dance with dragons I find this one very  interesting because the opposite  actually happens this time bran sees  Liana in a vision but he immediately  thinks he's looking at his sister Aria  as bran is in the weirwood net this is  what he sees two children danced across  the godswood hooting at one another as  they dueled with broken branches the  girl was the older and taller of the two  Aria bran thought eagerly as he watched  her leap up onto a rock and cut at the  boy but that couldn't be right if the  girl was Arya then the boy was brain  himself and he had never worn his hair  so long  Andorian never beat me playing swords  the way that girl is beating him she  slashed the boy across his thigh so hard  that his leg went out from under him and  he fell into the pool and began to  splash and shout you be quiet stupid the  girl said tossing her own branch aside  it's just water  do you want old man to hear and run tell  father now this is very interesting  because brain is actually seeing Liana  and benjin playing around and fighting  this reveals a few things besides Liana  and Aria looking alike this is also an  example of how similar they are in other  ways we know they look alike and we know  they ride horses alike and we know they  both like to fight and now we know they  even talk the same Liana told benjin to  be quiet stupid it's only water do you  want old man to hear and run tell father  now that sounds exactly like something  Oreo would say as I have been thinking  about this lately I have been wondering  if arias story will land in a similar  fashion as Leone has ended the most  interesting thing of all is what is  written in George RR Martin's original  outline before George ever got his first  book published he sent his first 13  chapters to a  friend Ralph and he gave him the basic  outline for what he planned on having  the story be about in that outline we  get a glimpse of what George wanted to  have happen with Aria and it's a perfect  parallel to Liana's own life now I do  have to say that what is written in this  outline has been drastically changed  since then but it's still interesting  nonetheless plus some of the themes have  not changed  George initially wanted Jon Snow and  Arya Stark to fall in love with each  other and even though this has changed  you can still see some remnants of this  in George's story today Jon and Ari are  obviously the closest out of the  siblings because they are always  thinking about each other but it's not  in any kind of a sexual way as he  intended at first but in this original  outline George also wanted Tyrion to  fall in love with Oreo and it says that  John and Tyrians relationship would turn  into a deadly rivalry over Arya Stark  now doesn't that sound a lot like Leone  his own story Robert and Rhaegar was  willing to die for Leona and it looks  like George was gonna have John and  Tyrion willing to die for Arya who is  said to look and act a lot like Leona  thankfully George did change most of his  plans for the story but he did keep some  of the big plot points John's parents  were still kept a secret in Oriya is  still a lot like Liana in this outline  George also stated which five main  characters he wanted to survive the  whole story in Oriya is one of those  characters he planned on having live  throughout everything there is no way to  know if George still intends on having  Arya live or not but he has laid out  some foreshadowing about her death so  perhaps he could have already died at a