 dying young likely on a dead or  possibly falling in love like Leon it  did and if she happened to fall in love  with Gendry who is Robert's son it would  be even more poetic but if I learned  anything from Ramsay Bolton it was this  if you think this has a happy ending he  who hasn't even paying attention let me  know what you think about this idea what  do you believe will happen with Arya  Stark at the end of this story  put all your questions and thoughts down  below in the comment section I want to  thank everyone for stopping by to watch  the video I really appreciate that and I  also want to thank everyone on patreon  that supports this channel have a great  day everyone I'll see you soon but  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]

